pageType: content
background:
  type: gradient
  gradientType: linear
  angle: 135
  stops:
    - {position: 0, color: "#0E1526"}
    - {position: 1, color: "#0A1E2E"}
elements:
  # ---------- 顶部标题区 ----------
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [28, 18, 700, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>让钠电储能自己会「体检」<span style="font-size:15px; color:$muted">　AI 预测电池寿命,提前躲开安全风险</span></p>
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 24, 200, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$primary"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 风象 08 天秤座 · 初焰·钠宙 S01
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [28, 64, 908, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}

  # ---------- 左栏:叙事 ----------
  - elementId: q-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [28, 82, 20, 20]
    iconName: "fas:circle-exclamation"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$danger"}
  - elementId: q-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 82, 492, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      bold: true
      color: "$danger"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 问题:AIDC 工况下,电池衰减不可见
  - elementId: q-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 104, 492, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>高倍率脉冲 + 低温 + 7×24 长时运行,衰减曲线藏在运行数据里。</p>
        <p>现状是「安全靠冗余、成本靠猜」——冗余容量是沉没成本,猜错了是安全事故。</p>

  - elementId: m-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [28, 158, 20, 20]
    iconName: "fas:gears"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: m-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 158, 492, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 方法:预测 + 门控 + 校准的运维管线
  - elementId: m-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 180, 492, 66]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>充放电曲线特征(IC 增量容量 / EIS 内阻)+ 分位数梯度提升 → 输出 SOH 点预测与 90% 区间;</p>
        <p><strong>分布外门控</strong>自动识别没见过的工况 → 触发「校准观察期」:区间放宽 + 前 10 循环在线校正;</p>
        <p>预测区间下限驱动自适应限流,反哺充放电策略。</p>

  # ---------- 左栏:四个关键数字 ----------
  - elementId: kpi1-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [28, 258, 252, 66]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: kpi1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [42, 264, 224, 54]
    content:
      lineHeight: 1.25
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:22px; color:$primary;"><strong>0.042 Ah</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:10px; color:$muted;">同工况 SOH 误差 ≈2%(留一电芯验证)</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi2-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [296, 258, 252, 66]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: kpi2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [310, 264, 224, 54]
    content:
      lineHeight: 1.25
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:22px; color:$accent;"><strong>-71%</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:10px; color:$muted;">4 ℃ 低温预测误差:0.299 → 0.088 Ah(校准观察期 + 物理归一化)</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi3-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [28, 334, 252, 66]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: kpi3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [42, 340, 224, 54]
    content:
      lineHeight: 1.25
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:22px; color:$primary;"><strong>95–100%</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:10px; color:$muted;">保形校准后 90% 区间真实覆盖率(分布内)</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi4-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [296, 334, 252, 66]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: kpi4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [310, 340, 224, 54]
    content:
      lineHeight: 1.25
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:22px; color:$accent;"><strong>+11.2%</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:10px; color:$muted;">自适应限流策略寿命期总吞吐(概念验证仿真)</span></p>

  # ---------- 左栏:洞察 ----------
  - elementId: i-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [28, 414, 20, 20]
    iconName: "fas:lightbulb"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: i-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 414, 492, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 洞察:跨温度泛化没有免费午餐
  - elementId: i-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 436, 492, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>保形校准、集成不确定性、CORAL 域适应在温度外推下全部失效(已留痕)——</p>
        <p>「前 10 循环校准观察期」是唯一现实解,也是可写进 BMS 的运维协议。钠电低温优势(0 ℃≈95% vs 锂电 4 ℃=64%)让鸿沟收窄,但锂电预训练模型必须经过校准才能迁移。</p>

  # ---------- 左栏:证据与局限 ----------
  - elementId: ev
    elementType: text
    bounds: [28, 496, 520, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 9.5
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>证据</strong>:1836 留痕 4 帖 + 开源仓库(9 轮迭代,13 脚本,全部可复跑) | 数据:NASA PCoE 19 只电芯 · 4 种工况</p>
        <p><strong>局限</strong>:方法在锂电公开数据上验证;钠电适配为文献外推(BatteryLife 钠电实测数据因仓库受限未能获取,已留痕)</p>

  # ---------- 右栏:核心图 ----------
  - elementId: fig-core
    elementType: image
    bounds: [576, 82, 360, 250]
    src: media/roadshow_core.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
    cropShape: {shapeName: roundRect, adjustments: [6000]}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: fig-loop
    elementType: image
    bounds: [576, 344, 360, 124]
    src: media/v05_closed_loop.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
    cropShape: {shapeName: roundRect, adjustments: [6000]}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: fig-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [576, 476, 360, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 9.5
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>上:四联证据链——同工况精度 / 低温误差阶梯 / 分布外拒识 / 闭环收益</p>
        <p>下:策略闭环仿真——预测区间下限触发的自适应限流延缓寿命终点</p>
